  <item>
    <title>30.未来，营销和销售一体化的新10年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672321e6cbe0e69c8b095acd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672321e6cbe0e69c8b095acd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 06:33:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>欢迎收听</span><strong><span>Willing Talk</span></strong><span>！</span></h2><span></span><p><span>本期节目分享嘉宾是：</span><br><span>👨卫瓴科技创始人兼CEO杨炯纬</span><br><span>👩Morketing创始人兼CEO曾巧</span><br><span></span><br><span>两位行业领袖将与我们一同探讨《未来营销和销售的新10年》。在本期节目中，我们将回顾过去十年移动互联网营销的指数级增长，分析行业关键事件，并预测未来十年广告营销行业的发展趋势。杨炯纬先生将分享他对于营销和销售融合的深刻见解，以及如何在数字化时代下，利用数据和技术解读品牌艺术。同时，我们也将探讨To B端市场在营销和销售一体化方面的挑战与机遇。这将是一场关于营销技术、品牌建设、私域运营和AI应用的精彩对话，不容错过！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>📖 节目亮点与时间轴：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒</span></strong><strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;移动互联网营销的变迁</span></strong><br><span>📈 回顾移动互联网营销的发展历程，探讨其对现代营销的影响。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒 </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;营销与销售的融合趋势</span></strong><br><span>🔄 分析品牌与效果的融合，以及营销技术如何推动这一变革。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒</span></strong><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;To B市场的营销和销售一体化</span></strong><br><span>🏢 探讨To B市场在营销和销售一体化方面的挑战与机遇。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒 </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;私域运营的挑战与机遇</span></strong><br><span>📊 讨论私域运营的现状，以及如何通过内容营销提升私域运营效果。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒 </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;AI在营销和销售中的应用</span></strong><br><span>🤖 探讨AI如何加速销售与营销的融合，以及其在内容生产和决策辅助中的作用。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒 </span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;卫瓴科技的增长与未来展望</span></strong><br><span>📈 分享卫瓴科技的增长情况，以及对未来营销行业的预测。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>🕒 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;- </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> </span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;品牌、平台和渠道之间的平衡</span></strong><br><span>🔍 讨论品牌、平台和渠道之间寻找平衡的策略，分析白牌产品如何依赖平台和渠道力量。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🤝 加入卫瓴科技，一起探索更多！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢您收听本期《未来营销和销售的新10年》播客节目。我们相信，在这个不断变化的数字时代，每一次对话都可能激发新的灵感和创新。🚀</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您想要获取【</span><strong><span>本期节目飞书妙计逐字稿</span></strong><span>】或者进入【</span><strong><span>杨炯纬商业思考交流群</span></strong><span>】欢迎扫描下方二维码添加好友</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmvmZkNs95WVBiWWNGXOuhb-8Ys0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔗 </span><strong><span>关注</span></strong><a href="https://www.weiling.cn/" data-url="https://www.weiling.cn/"><span>卫瓴科技</span></a><strong><span>，添加我们的联系方式，让我们在数字化的浪潮中一起前行！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
